1244 0 obj
<<
/Title (The longer-term COP roadmap included case management, SLA visibility, self-service, e-commerce, and lifecycle support across BUs. Even when designing an asset page, I was designing inside a portal trying to evolve from a legacy tool into a scalable platform. That awareness shaped how I approached scope, restraint, and future-proofing throughout the project.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1114 0 R
/First 1349 0 R
/Last 1349 0 R
/Count -1
>>
