1255 0 obj
<<
/Title (Using many BUs for discovery is valuable. Using all of them equally in detailed weekly design decisions creates friction, delays, and instability. The right model: wide input early, narrow decision group for detailed execution. The process owner later acknowledged this explicitly.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1119 0 R
>>
endobj
1256 0 obj
<<
/Title (Sites and Assets should have been split earlier)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 27 0 R
/Prev 1119 0 R
/First 1364 0 R
/Last 1364 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 1120 0 R
>>
endobj
1257 0 obj
<<
/Title (Stakeholder interpretation is not user validation. Even limited customer contact early would have grounded the direction more reliably. When real customer feedback eventually arrived, it was more useful than weeks of BU debate.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1120 0 R
>>
endobj
